":"May be involved in the formation and stability of synapses as well as being involved in the clustering of nicotinic acetylcholine receptors."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}